00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:57.060
- The way I started and
learned how to do that

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:58.923
is because I was really lonely.

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:02.610
I'm not kidding, I was like 12 years old.

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:03.540
There was no dates.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.190
I was sitting at ho at home alone,

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:06.157
I was looking in the
mirror, and I was like,

00:02:06.157 --> 00:02:07.347
"Oh, oh wow."

00:02:09.027 --> 00:02:10.744
You know, 12 year old
boys come up with some

00:02:10.744 --> 00:02:11.610
really ridiculous things.

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:14.610
