are your two nipples,

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:16.770
that is really lonely.

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:18.420
So, Happy New Year to you buddy.

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:19.318
- Thank you.

00:02:19.318 --> 00:02:22.140
- And, your resolution, somebody said,

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:24.060
