00:02:25.913 --> 00:02:28.710
- First of all, I have the resolution

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:30.600
that takes care of itself every year.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:32.880
'Cause I've been going to the
gym straight for 30 years.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:36.600
I'm like, "Okay, go to
the gym for 31 years."

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.427
So now it's like, the next year.

00:02:38.427 --> 00:02:39.630
- But you go to the gym.

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:42.660
So, this guy works harder
than anybody I've ever seen.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:44.610
You always have like 90 projects.

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:45.630
There's so much more to tell.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:47.400
You are so much more than what people see.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.703
And we're gonna talk about
more of that when we come back.

00:02:49.703 --> 00:02:50.940
