00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:56.730
You are brilliant at hosting that show,

00:02:56.730 --> 00:03:00.540
because not only are you moving
this freight train along,

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:03.990
but you are consoling
people who didn't rise

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:06.000
